Electrical response to atmospheric guests: By combining experimental data with computational modelling, we describe a possible origin for the underlying mechanism of the direct dependence of the electrical response with MOF/guest interaction phenomenon in ultrathin films (\(\sim\)30 nm) of Cu-CAT-1.
